eDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int8.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int9.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int10.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int11.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int12.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int13.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int14.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int15.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int16.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int17.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int18.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int19.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int20.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int21.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3mg-CUD-int22.html\">ClinicalUseDefinition: type = interaction</a></li><li><a href=\"ClinicalUseDefinition-GlimepiridaAurovitas3